    "text": "#Iraq is holding a tender to hire two or more oil supertankers to perform transits through the Strait of Hormuz, a step that would help to ensure the country’s crude exports while the waterway remains under military threat.\n\nState-run Iraqi Oil Tankers Co. is holding a tender, which closes on Thursday, seeking the rental for 180 days of two very large crude carriers to deliver the nation’s oil through Hormuz, according to a notice on the oil ministry’s website.\n#oott https://t.co/ZgxE7ZMn5c",
