    "id": "2098024945645142234",
    "text": "But by far the most interesting piece of data in this report is a direct communication from Saudi Arabia stuffed in a footnote—Saudi crude **production** cratered through August to the lowest level since 1990.\n\nThe “official” numbers reflect Saudi “supply to market”, but Riyadh also noted (see highlight below) that actual production crashed 1,897 kbpd from July to 6,238 kbpd in August as the Houthi maritime ban mucked up reroute Saudi logistics and attacks hit infrastructure.",
    "createdAt": "2026-09-10T12:25:01+00:00",
